                     (193500 x 178600 units)
Window area = 11533600000 square units
Fraction of frame area: 0.334
```


:::
:::



We will next use *spattemp.density()* to compute the STKDE.



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
kde_yday <- spattemp.density(
  fire_yday_owin)
summary(kde_yday)
```

