## **Computing spatio-temporal KDE**

With the h and lambda values derived from *BOOT.spattemp()*, we can use them to compute our STKDE with the following code chunk.



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
kde_yday <- spattemp.density(fire_yday_owin,
                             h = 9000,
                             lambda = 19)
summary(kde_yday)
```

